  "title": "Pohela Boishakh",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**পহেলা বৈশাখ** — the first day of the month Boishakh — is the Bengali New Year, celebrated on **14 April** in Bangladesh by people of every religion. Greet everyone with **শুভ নববর্ষ!** 'Happy New Year!'\n\nTraditions: wearing red and white (লাল-সাদা), the colourful **মঙ্গল শোভাযাত্রা** procession in Dhaka, streets painted with **আলপনা**, a village-style **মেলা** (fair), and a breakfast of **পান্তা ভাত** with ইলিশ.\n\nThe pattern **শুভ + occasion** is very productive: **শুভ নববর্ষ**, **শুভ জন্মদিন** (happy birthday), **শুভ সকাল** (good morning, a bit formal).\n\n**Kolkata:** **পয়লা বৈশাখ** (*poyla boishakh*), usually on 14 or 15 April.",
